    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19840" root="سعف" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعْفٌ</span></b>  <i>A commodity; an article of merchandise.</i>
(O, K, TA.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُ سَعْفُ سَوْءٍ</span> <i>Verily it is
a bad commodity.</i> (O, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A man vile,</i>
or <i>mean, and despised in all his circumstances.</i>
(AHeyth, O, K.)

